If we sign with your company,

556
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:32,840
your schedule

557
00:30:32,840 --> 00:30:33,990
will clash with our national tournament's

558
00:30:33,990 --> 00:30:34,990
schedule, right?

559
00:30:38,840 --> 00:30:40,270
That's possible.

560
00:30:40,990 --> 00:30:42,320
But you have to know that

561
00:30:42,670 --> 00:30:44,880
UBA is just a college league.

562
00:30:45,670 --> 00:30:47,030
Your ultimate dream

563
00:30:47,080 --> 00:30:48,750
is to become professional players.

564
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:49,560
I got it.

565
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,430
You want us

566
00:30:52,030 --> 00:30:53,030
to give up the team

567
00:30:53,210 --> 00:30:54,140
for our own sake.

568
00:30:56,670 --> 00:30:59,000
Maybe you can't understand our thoughts.

569
00:30:59,230 --> 00:31:00,950
Although we play in the college league

570
00:31:00,950 --> 00:31:03,550
and also want to become
professional players,

571
00:31:03,710 --> 00:31:04,750
all of us

572
00:31:05,190 --> 00:31:06,990
are working hard for our dreams.

573
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:09,020
We won't give up on our teammates.

574
00:31:09,120 --> 00:31:10,520
Thank you for your offer.

575
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,020
How about this?

576
00:31:17,270 --> 00:31:18,200
There's no rush.

577
00:31:18,510 --> 00:31:19,600
Go back

578
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:21,120
and think about it carefully.

579
00:31:21,120 --> 00:31:22,600
If you have any new ideas,

580
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:24,130
you can contact me anytime.

581
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:32,710
Thank you.

582
00:31:40,670 --> 00:31:42,730
Let your leg rest well to recuperate.

583
00:31:45,080 --> 00:31:45,710
Let's go.

584
00:31:53,340 --> 00:31:55,260
[Bai Xue Basketball]

585
00:32:01,840 --> 00:32:03,080
You gave the ticket to my mom

586
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:04,160
behind my back.

587
00:32:07,470 --> 00:32:08,190
Thank you.

588
00:32:18,080 --> 00:32:19,810
This feels quite strange to me.

589
00:32:20,270 --> 00:32:21,710
When my mom left just now,

590
00:32:22,510 --> 00:32:23,510
I had a feeling.

591
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:27,400
I felt like

592
00:32:28,750 --> 00:32:30,350
my mom had really become old.

593
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:34,680
I always complain
that she doesn't care about me,

594
00:32:34,880 --> 00:32:35,880
but actually,

595
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:39,000
I don't seem to care much
about her, either.

596
00:32:43,510 --> 00:32:46,190
Time will definitely
make our parents grow old,

597
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,800
but it also makes us grow up.

598
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:52,950
When we grow up,
we can protect them properly.

599
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:58,160
Today,
when Auntie Wan saw you doing your best,

600
00:32:58,160 --> 00:32:59,360
she was very touched.

601
00:33:00,470 --> 00:33:01,160
I saw that.

602
00:33:03,470 --> 00:33:04,560
When she left,

603
00:33:05,360 --> 00:33:06,270
I thought

604
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,370
she didn't approve of me again.

605
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,860
I just couldn't accept it,

606
00:33:10,270 --> 00:33:11,470
so I got up from the bench

607
00:33:11,470 --> 00:33:12,600
and rushed up again.

608
00:33:17,950 --> 00:33:20,210
You've eaten star fruits before, right?

609
00:33:20,470 --> 00:33:22,270
The workers who grow star fruits

610
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,800
sometimes make a few cuts

611
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:25,190
on the trees with a knife.

612
00:33:25,190 --> 00:33:26,400
Do you know why?

613
00:33:27,080 --> 00:33:27,750
Why?

614
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:29,950
Because some trees

615
00:33:29,950 --> 00:33:32,190
can't produce delicious fruits.

616
00:33:32,430 --> 00:33:34,230
When that happens, experienced workers

617
00:33:34,230 --> 00:33:36,640
will make cuts on them with a knife.

618
00:33:37,120 --> 00:33:39,030
Then the trees will think they're injured.

619
00:33:39,030 --> 00:33:40,160
To heal themselves,

620
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:42,320
they will desperately take roots

621
00:33:42,320 --> 00:33:43,580
and absorb nutrients.

622
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:45,510
This way, they can produce many

623
00:33:45,510 --> 00:33:47,750
big and delicious fruits.

624
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:52,480
I think
trees and people are actually the same.

625
00:33:52,670 --> 00:33:55,470
Only in desperate situations
will they go all out.

626
00:34:03,190 --> 00:34:05,400
I want to thank you properly.

627
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:06,880
I know that

628
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:10,070
if you hadn't used the reverse psychology

629
00:34:10,070 --> 00:34:11,199
to force me to sign up

630
00:34:11,429 --> 00:34:13,030
or taken me to that square

631
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:14,400
to make me read the news,

632
00:34:14,880 --> 00:34:16,070
I would never have overcome my fear

633
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:17,670
or made it to where I am today.

634
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:23,100
Then let's make a deal.

635
00:34:24,070 --> 00:34:25,989
From now on, if either of us

636
00:34:26,150 --> 00:34:27,949
refuses to work hard and slacks off,

637
00:34:27,949 --> 00:34:29,280
we'll be that knife for each other.
